": "Signals intensifying SEA experiential-retail competition among jewelry houses, a benchmark for Gucci's own Asia retail activation strategy.", "relevance": "benchmark opportunity"}, {"brand": "Cartier", "event_type": "campaign", "headline": "까르띠에, 2027 Talents of Tomorrow 상 워치메이킹·주얼리 통합 공모 개시", "summary": "Cartier opened applications on October 1 for its renamed 2027 Talents of Tomorrow Prize, now combining watchmaking and jewelry under a single 'Wild Fauna' theme; entries close November 30, 2026.", "url": "https://wwd.com/accessories-news/jewelry/cartier-jewelry-talents-of-tomorrow-prize-1239285618", "source": "WWD", "tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-10-01", "why_it_matters": "장인 육성·브랜드 신뢰 구축 프로그램으로 까르띠에가 워치·주얼리 정체성을 통합 강화하는 움직임 — 구찌의 하이주얼리 부재와 대비됨", "why_it_matters_en": "A craft-talent pipeline program consolidating Cartier's combined watch-and-jewelry identity, underscoring the category-building investment gap versus Gucci's thin high-jewelry presence.", "relevance": "category trend"}, {"brand": "Chanel", "event_type": "executive", "headline": "샤넬, 전 까르띠에 주얼리 크리에이티브 디렉터 마리로르 세레드를 주얼리 스튜디오 총괄로 영입 (10월 취임)", "summary": "Chanel confirmed Marie-Laure Cerede — Cartier's creative director of jewelry and watchmaking from 2016 to end-2025, previously 14 years at Harry Winston — takes up her new role as Director of Chanel's Jewelry Creation Studio this October, filling the post vacant since Patrice Leguereau's 2024 death.", "url": "https://wwd.com/business-news/human-resources/chanel-marie-laure-cerede-jewelry-creation-studio-director-1239001752/", "source": "WWD", "tier": "T1", "published_at": "2026-10-01", "why_it_matters": "경쟁 하우스가 까르띠에의 핵심 주얼리 인재를 빼가는 최상급 인재 유출 사례 — 하이주얼리 크리에이티브 리더십을 둘러싼 업계 전쟁이 격화 중임을 보여줌", "why_it_matters_en": "A top-tier talent poach of Cartier's own jewelry creative leadership by a rival Maison, illustrating how fierce the competition for high-jewelry creative direction has become across the sector.", "relevance": "category trend"}, {"brand": 