d cause campaigns.", "relevance": "benchmark opportunity"}, {"brand": "Patek Philippe", "event_type": "show", "headline": "파텍필립 Watch Art Grand Exhibition, 밀라노서 10월 2일 개막 (7번째 순회전)", "summary": "Patek Philippe's Watch Art Grand Exhibition opens free to the public October 2-18, 2026 at CityOval, Piazza Sei Febbraio in Milan — the seventh edition of a touring exhibition series that has drawn 165,000 visitors across prior stops in Dubai, Munich, London, New York, Singapore and Tokyo.", "url": "https://monochrome-watches.com/news-patek-philippe-watch-art-grand-exhibition-is-coming-to-milan-in-2026/", "source": "Monochrome Watches", "tier": "T2", "published_at": "2026-09-30", "why_it_matters": "무료 대형 전시를 통한 유산 브랜딩은 고객 접점 없이도 브랜드 신화를 구축하는 방식 — 구찌의 전시·문화 이벤트 전략에 참고할 포맷", "why_it_matters_en": "Free large-scale heritage exhibitions build brand mythology without direct retail transaction, a format Gucci could study for its own cultural-event strategy.", "relevance": "benchmark opportunity"}, {"brand": "Tiffany", "event_type": "campaign", "headline": "티파니, LVMH 'Les Journees Particulieres' 2026서 뉴욕 공방 일반 공개 (10월 16-18일)", "summary": "Tiffany & Co.'s New York jewelry workshop will open to the public for LVMH's biennial Les Journees Particulieres open-house event running October 16-18, 2026, alongside other LVMH Maisons including Dior Couture, Fendi and Moet & Chandon.", "url": "https://hoodline.com/2026/09/lvmh-opens-tiffany-jewelry-workshop-doors-for-rare-free-peek/", "source": "Hoodline", "tier": "T2", "published_at": "2026-09-30", "why_it_matters": "LVMH가 공방 투명성·장인정신을 소비자 접점으로 활용하는 그룹 차원 캠페인 — 케어링도 유사한 아틀리에 공개 이니셔티브를 검토할 만한 포맷", "why_it_matters_en": "An LVMH group-wide campaign using atelier transparency and craftsmanship access as a consumer touchpoint — a format Kering could consider replicating for Gucci.", "relevance": "benchmark opportunity"}, {"brand": "Bulgari", "event_type": "campaign", "headline": "불가리, 허드슨 윌리엄스 기용 세르펜티 캠페인 단편 필름 공개", "summary": "Bulgari released a 